+Source of build: PAPERCLIP_RUN_SCRATCH_DIR/repo at tag v2026.1117.0 (commit c0f1328).
+Nothing was deployed; no live service, /root/.paperclip/cli, /opt, /usr/local/bin, or systemd was touched.
