+
+Verification
+------------
+Typecheck: CI=true corepack pnpm --filter @paperclipai/ui typecheck -> PASS (clean).
+  Initial run failed only on missing @paperclipai/plugin-sdk/ui declarations; after building the
+  required workspace packages it passed with no errors in patched files.
