+  ui/src/components/IssueProperties.test.tsx ui/src/components/AgentConfigForm.render.test.tsx
+  -> 2 files passed, 301 tests passed (includes 9 new stage-decision tests).
+Dependency build: CI=true NODE_ENV=development corepack pnpm --filter @paperclipai/plugin-sdk
+  --filter @paperclipai/shared --filter @paperclipai/adapter-utils --filter @paperclipai/db build -> PASS.
+  Nested scripts call bare pnpm, so a scratch-only pnpm shim
+  (PAPERCLIP_RUN_SCRATCH_DIR/opencode/pnpm) was prepended to PATH.
+UI build: CI=true NODE_ENV=production corepack pnpm build (in ui/) -> PASS (8267 modules, built in 8.91s).
