+---------------------------------------
+ui/src/components/issue-properties/IssueProperties.tsx
+  38    import useOptionalToastActions
+  1115-1151 pendingStageDecision gate, comment state/mutation, invalid-comment guard,
+        draft reset keyed by stage type + participant (mutation reset in deps instead of
