+- Description-edit patch was intentionally not applied: marker is already upstream in 2026.1117.0.
+- Reference test's useOptionalToastActions mock addition was not needed: already present at line 118
+  of the 2026.1117.0 test harness.
+- Reference test's empty update mock response was adapted to a valid comment receipt as noted above.
+- No test cases from the reference block were skipped. Full repo test suite was not run; only the
+  two relevant test files.
+
+Risks
+-----
+- Runtime fallback behavior (opencode_local retry on provider token/quota errors) is server/adapter
+  side and was not exercised here; only the UI configuration surface and built markers were verified.
+- Production build emitted pre-existing warnings (unsupported Vite native-config features, ::highlight
+  CSS pseudo-element warnings, chunk-size and ineffective dynamic-import warnings); build succeeded.
